  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Offering a mix of distance and blended learning degree courses, Arden University empowers students in their academics and careers.</p><p>Arden’s modern digital learning platforms, industry accreditation, and partnerships with institutions like the National Health Service (NHS) and The Chartered Institute of Personnel Development (CIPD) help students transform their careers.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>Arden does not offer full-time accommodation services, due to the flexible nature of study.&nbsp;</p><p>However, you can find suitable accommodation near your preferred study location, through one of the following housing services, but not limited to:</p><ul><li>Accommodation for Students</li><li>Mystudenthalls</li><li>CRM Students</li><li>Pure Student Living</li><li>iQ Student Accommodation</li><li>Rightmove Student Accommodation</li></ul>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Lab",
      "value": "<p>All campuses have state-of-the-art lab facilities, with modern computers and IT equipment.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student Life",
      "value": "<p>You will experience a lively and friendly atmosphere at Arden’s study centres in London, Manchester, or Birmingham.</p><p>Arden University’s Students’ Association lets you engage in various academic and social communities and clubs.</p><p>You can interact with success coaches and academic skills tutors, and attend academic skills workshops and dissertation support sessions.</p><p>The University has a full-service online careers portal to help you with your career development needs, such as searching for jobs and preparing for interviews.</p><p>Outside of classes, you’ll have access to individual and group study spaces, and many excellent facilities, such as modern computers and IT equipment, internet and printing services.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
